# the FOD check's automatic local store (used when the default store is not
# writable — a landlock'd talos pod; see fod-eval-check/README.md), and the
# nix fetcher/eval cache + uv script environments it works with — in-pod the
# check runs with HOME=$PWD XDG_CACHE_HOME=$PWD/.cache, so both are
# regenerable pod-HOME artifacts (the mise state under $PWD/.local likewise).
# Anchored to the repo root: nested .cache/.local dirs (if any) stay visible.
/.cache/
/.local/
